msgid "cuda.tile.maximum"
msgstr "cuda.tile.maximum"

#: cuda.tile._stub.maximum:1 of
msgid "Elementwise maximum on two tiles."
msgstr "求两个 Tile 的逐元素最大值。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.maximum:3 of
msgid "Can also use builtin operation `max(x, y)`."
msgstr "也可使用内置运算 ``max(x, y)`` 。"

#: ../../source/generated/cuda.tile.maximum.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.maximum:5 of
msgid "LHS tile."
msgstr "左操作数（LHS）Tile。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.maximum:7 of
msgid ""
"RHS tile. flush_to_zero (const bool): If True, flushes subnormal inputs "
"and results to sign-preserving zero, default is False. propagate_nan "
"(const bool): Float types only. If False (the default), NaN inputs are "
"ignored. If True, NaN propagates: a NaN makes the result NaN for min/max,"
" and argmin/argmax return the index of the first NaN."
msgstr ""
"右操作数（RHS）Tile。 ``flush_to_zero`` (const bool)：若为 "
"True，则将次正规（subnormal）输入和结果刷零（保留符号），默认为 False。 ``propagate_nan`` (const "
"bool)：仅适用于浮点类型。若为 False（默认值），则忽略 NaN 输入；若为 True，则传播 NaN：对于 ``min`` / "
"``max`` ，输入中的 NaN 会使结果为 NaN，而 ``argmin`` / ``argmax`` 会返回第一个 NaN 的索引。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.maximum:12 of
msgid ""
"The `shape` of `x` and `y` will be broadcasted and `dtype` promoted to "
"common dtype."
msgstr "``x`` 和 ``y`` 的 ``shape`` 将会进行广播，且 ``dtype`` 会提升为公共数据类型（common dtype）。"

